WEBVTT

00:02:59.484 --> 00:03:03.669
of people and doctors
who go to developing nations

00:03:03.693 --> 00:03:05.976
to offer plastic surgery
to those who need it.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:09.662
Children with cleft palates get it,
and they document their story.

00:03:09.686 --> 00:03:10.976
This is wonderful.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:13.976
I am not that caring.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.727
(Laughter)

00:03:16.751 --> 00:03:17.927
I talk about myself.

00:03:17.951 --> 00:03:19.544
That's what I am. I'm a blogger.

00:03:19.568 --> 00:03:23.097
I have always decided that I was going
to be an expert on one thing,

00:03:23.121 --> 00:03:25.351
and I am an expert on this person,

00:03:25.375 --> 00:03:27.540
and so I write about it.

00:03:27.842 --> 00:03:29.485
So, the short story about my blog:

00:03:29.509 --> 00:03:31.660
it started in 2001, I was 23.